 "examples": {
  "test/both": "The door was latched: it opens when I keep turning the ball part p8 while pushing. It was also locked: it only opened after I put the object o3 into the disc part p1 and turned it.",
  "test/deadbolt": "The door was latched: it opens when I keep turning the bar part p8 while pushing. It was probably also bolted: it only moved after I turned the round part p2 (or after I turned the wing part p4: I could not tell which).",
  "test/key_drawer": "The door was latched: it opens when I keep turning the round part p1 while pulling. It was also locked: it only opened after I put the object o1 I found inside the panel part p6 into the disc part p5 and turned it.",
  "test/key_table": "The door was latched: it opens when I keep turning the bar part p1 while pushing (I did not check that plain pushing fails there). It was also bolted: it only moved after I turned the round part p6. It was also locked: it only opened after I put the object o1 into the disc part p2 and turned it. Object o2 did not go in.",
  "test/latch": "The door was latched: it opens when I keep turning the ball part p4 while pushing.",
  "test/no_solution": "I could not open it and stopped after 509 actions: I opened every container I found, tried every object I found in every part, and tested every rule I could still bring about. Object o1 went into the disc part p1 but did not turn it. The disc part p1 is probably a lock whose key is not within my reach.",
  "test/unlocked": "The door opens by pushing the wing part p2.",
  "train/both": "The door was latched: it opens when I keep turning the bar part p7 while pulling. It was also locked: it only opened after I put the object o2 I found inside the panel part p4 into the disc part p5 and turned it.",
  "train/deadbolt": "The door was latched: it opens when I keep turning the bar part p8 while pulling.",
  "train/key_drawer": "The door was latched: it opens when I keep turning the ball part p6 while pulling. It was also locked: it only opened after I put the object o3 I found inside the panel part p4 into the disc part p8 and turned it.",
  "train/key_table": "The door was latched: it opens when I keep turning the round part p5 while pushing (I did not check that plain pushing fails there). It was also bolted: it only moved after I turned the round part p2. It was also locked: it only opened after I put the object o2 into the disc part p7 and turned it.",
  "train/latch": "The door was latched: it opens when I keep turning the bar part p5 while pulling.",
  "train/no_solution": "I could not open it and stopped after 233 actions: I opened every container I found, tried every object I found in every part, and tested every rule I could still bring about. What holds it is probably the disc part p3: none of my actions changed it, and nothing I found went into it.",
